{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"overall\": [\"C2\", \"C1\", \"C3\"],\n  \"keep\": [\"C2\", \"C1\", \"C3\"],\n  \"cover\": [\"C2\", \"C1\", \"C3\"],\n  \"lean\": [\"C3\", \"C1\", \"C2\"],\n  \"plain\": [\"C1\", \"C2\", \"C3\"],\n  \"why\": \"overall：C2虽然有少许重复，但既保住了自我调整带来的满足，也写出了从自在付出到想抓紧亲近、重新发慌的转折，综合最完整。keep：C2明确写出了关心、替对方高兴、给予本身的快乐、紧张减弱、不计较且不怕显得更在乎、心意充足以及误把暂时轻松当成保证；C1和C3都没有充分写出给予本身带来的满足，C1略胜C3。cover：C2的抓紧亲近、因此发慌、热情到盛处又收住，最直接解释了B3的紧握与失衡以及B2的情绪高点和退落，也能带出B4的不舍；C1次之，C3与C1相近，但情绪升温的交代稍弱。lean：C3的心理步骤最少，C1稍多了热切升起的描写但仍然顺畅，C2则在第三条两次强调付出本身带来的满足，信息略有重复。plain：C1的舍不得这一刻过去、怕成了催促，都像一个人在具体地说自己的心事；C2次之，部分表达稍显归纳，C3的想确认自己是否特别的紧张这一句式略显抽象生硬。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f164bf45-48f3-49ec-aabc-e632dc13bd1d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T230304488739Z", "elapsed_seconds": 96.688, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T23:04:41.188076+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6b627d69fd24c707d89953c9aa615226782171e6a61f7a01a9a2715ed88a64f8", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c